## Integration Architecture

The system connects these components through:

1. Timeline Analysis Layer
- Tracks psychological state changes
- Maps interventions to outcomes
- Generates clinical interpretations
- Produces comparative analysis

2. Therapeutic Response Layer
- Maps modalities to symptoms
- Calculates therapy match scores
- Defines effectiveness metrics
- Implements contraindication logic

## Domain Value Drivers

1. Psychological Development Modeling
- Trauma impact simulation
- Disorder progression tracking
- Treatment effectiveness calculation
